      "text": "Welcome to Roberto's tastefully restored home in downtown Guadalajara, Mexico. Every wall tells a story here, adorned with his impressive collection of art and books that reflect a lifetime of curiosity and passion. Roberto spends much of his time reading and writing in his study, surrounded by the things he loves. The indoor-outdoor courtyard, a hallmark of classic Guadalajara architecture, brings light and life into the heart of the home. Thank you Roberto!",
